     <target value="5.00">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">The five sectors mentioned in the RI are: Energy (DMRE), Transport (DoT), Trade and Industry (DTIC), Agriculture (DALRRD), and Water and Sanitation (DWS).
The achievement of the target was delayed, but there is ongoing progress. The Climate Change Bill was approved by the National Council of Provinces on April 25, 2024. On April 26th, the DFFE published for a 60-day public comment period the SETs for Agriculture, Industry, Energy, Minerals, Human Settlements, Transport, and Environment (e.g. forestry and waste management). These seven sectors represent all the sectors that are targeted for a SET per the Climate Change Bill.</narrative>
